        <mxCell id="home-cold" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:20px;line-height:28px;text-align:left;white-space:nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:0px;&quot;&gt;Show the loading percentage on black. Wait for the page, fonts and visible images&lt;br&gt;plus the 3D scene.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;Loading time varies. At 100%, the loading screen fades away over 0.5 s. Page&lt;br&gt;animations wait until it is gone.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;Start the following times after the loading screen disappears:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;0–0.4 s: a small point fades into view.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;0.4–1.1 s: the point opens into a square.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;1.1–1.8 s: the square opens into a cube.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;1.8–2.5 s: the cube opens into a tesseract.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;At 2.5 s, the shape starts moving and responding to the pointer.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;2.5–3 s: the title and “Click here to explore” fade in together.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;With reduced motion, the loading fade and page entrance are skipped.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=24;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#111111;fontColor=#111111;strokeWidth=2;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="120" y="780" width="800" height="620" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="home-origin" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:30px;line-height:40px;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:0px;&quot;&gt;Nav menu opened&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:0px;&quot;&gt;from other pages&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=24;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#111111;fontColor=#111111;strokeWidth=2;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1130" y="100" width="600" height="130" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="home-arrival" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:20px;line-height:28px;text-align:left;white-space:nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:0px;&quot;&gt;Select Home in a menu opened from another page.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;Over 0.5 s, the menu links slide upward out of view and Close fades out.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;If leaving Works, allow 1 s for its two-part exit; other pages allow 0.5 s.&lt;br&gt;Then request the new page.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;The white menu stays in place until the new page is ready, then disappears.&lt;br&gt;Loading may add a pause.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;The wordmark also fades out during the first 0.5 s.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;Once Home is ready, a white cover moves upward off the screen over 1 s,&lt;br&gt;revealing the black background.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;Then the scene begins: point fades in (0–0.4 s), square opens (0.4–1.1 s),&lt;br&gt;cube opens (1.1–1.8 s), tesseract opens (1.8–2.5 s).&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;At 2.5 s, the shape starts moving. The title and Explore link fade in from 2.5&lt;br&gt;to 3 s.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;Home finishes entering 4 s after it is ready. Any route-loading wait comes&lt;br&gt;before this.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=24;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#111111;fontColor=#111111;strokeWidth=2;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1060" y="285" width="740" height="620" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="home-menu" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:30px;line-height:40px;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:0px;&quot;&gt;Nav menu&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=24;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#111111;fontColor=#111111;strokeWidth=2;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="2690" y="795" width="350" height="140" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="home-close" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:20px;line-height:28px;text-align:left;white-space:nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:0px;&quot;&gt;Click Close, or select Home again.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;0–0.5 s: the links slide upward out of view; the menu wordmark&lt;br&gt;and Close fade out.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;0.2–1.2 s: the white panel moves upward off the screen, revealing&lt;br&gt;Home. The two stages overlap for 0.3 s.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;The 3D scene resumes as closing starts. Its entrance does not&lt;br&gt;restart.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=24;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#111111;fontColor=#111111;strokeWidth=2;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1880" y="565" width="650" height="360" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="home-open" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:20px;line-height:28px;text-align:left;white-space:nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:0px;&quot;&gt;Click “Click here to explore”.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;0–1 s: a white panel rises from the bottom to cover Home. The&lt;br&gt;menu contents stay in place as it passes.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;0.7–1.2 s: the menu links rise into view; the dark wordmark and&lt;br&gt;Close fade in.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;At 1 s, the covered 3D scene pauses. The menu is fully visible at&lt;br&gt;1.2 s.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=24;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#111111;fontColor=#111111;strokeWidth=2;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1880" y="1030" width="650" height="380" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="home-to-works" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:20px;line-height:28px;text-align:left;white-space:nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:0px;&quot;&gt;Use Back / Forward to return to a previously visited Works page, with&lt;br&gt;the menu closed.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;A white cover rises from the bottom over 1 s, hiding Home. Once it&lt;br&gt;fully covers the screen, continue to the selected history entry.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;Once Works is ready, restart the times below. Loading may add a&lt;br&gt;pause:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;The pictures are uncovered from bottom to top while staying in place:&lt;br&gt;Genesis takes 0.8 s, shanzhy.io 0.5 s, and Workspace 1 s. All three&lt;br&gt;start together.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;The heading waits 0.5 s, then slides up into view over 0.5 s.&lt;br&gt;Everything finishes at 1 s.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;The wordmark and Menu also fade in over 1 s.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;With reduced motion, these page animations and the exit wait are&lt;br&gt;skipped.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=24;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#111111;fontColor=#111111;strokeWidth=2;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="100" y="1590" width="680" height="650" />
        </mxCell>
