          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="5890" y="795" width="350" height="140" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="works-close" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:20px;line-height:28px;text-align:left;white-space:nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:0px;&quot;&gt;Click Close, or select Works again.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;0–0.5 s: the links slide upward out of view.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;0.5–1 s: the white panel fades away.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;Close fades out in the first 0.5 s; Menu fades in during the next&lt;br&gt;0.5 s. The wordmark stays visible.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;The same page is revealed; its entrance does not restart.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=24;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#111111;fontColor=#111111;strokeWidth=2;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="5080" y="565" width="650" height="360" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="works-open" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:20px;line-height:28px;text-align:left;white-space:nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:0px;&quot;&gt;Click Menu.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;0–0.5 s: the white menu panel fades in over the page. The&lt;br&gt;wordmark stays visible.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;0.5–1 s: the menu links slide upward into view.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;The Menu label fades out over the first 0.5 s; Close fades in over&lt;br&gt;the next 0.5 s.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;The page stays underneath; its exit animation does not run.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;A hovered picture also returns to its usual width and grayscale&lt;br&gt;over 0.5 s; its name fades out in 0.2 s.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=24;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#111111;fontColor=#111111;strokeWidth=2;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="5080" y="1030" width="650" height="380" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="works-to-home" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:20px;line-height:28px;text-align:left;white-space:nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:0px;&quot;&gt;Use Back / Forward to return to a previously visited Home page, with&lt;br&gt;the menu closed.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;0–0.5 s: pictures return to their usual width and grayscale; project&lt;br&gt;names fade away.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;0.5–1 s: the heading slides up out of view and the pictures are&lt;br&gt;covered from bottom to top. Then change page.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;The wordmark and Menu fade out during this 1 s exit.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;Once Home is ready, a white cover moves upward off the screen&lt;br&gt;over 1 s, revealing the black background.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;Then the scene begins: point fades in (0–0.4 s), square opens&lt;br&gt;(0.4–1.1 s), cube opens (1.1–1.8 s), tesseract opens (1.8–2.5 s).&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;At 2.5 s, the shape starts moving. The title and Explore link fade in&lt;br&gt;from 2.5 to 3 s.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;Home finishes entering 4 s after it is ready. Any route-loading wait&lt;br&gt;comes before this.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;With reduced motion, these page animations and the exit wait are&lt;br&gt;skipped.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=24;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#111111;fontColor=#111111;strokeWidth=2;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="3300" y="1590" width="680" height="650" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="works-target-home" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:30px;line-height:40px;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:0px;&quot;&gt;Home&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=24;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#111111;fontColor=#111111;strokeWidth=2;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="3500" y="2320" width="280" height="100" />
