        <mxCell id="works-to-about" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:20px;line-height:28px;text-align:left;white-space:nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:0px;&quot;&gt;Use Back / Forward to return to a previously visited About page, with&lt;br&gt;the menu closed.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;0–0.5 s: pictures return to their usual width and grayscale; project&lt;br&gt;names fade away.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;0.5–1 s: the heading slides up out of view and the pictures are&lt;br&gt;covered from bottom to top. Then change page.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;Once About is ready, restart the times below. Loading may add a&lt;br&gt;pause:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;Each line of the heading and paragraphs rises slightly and fades in,&lt;br&gt;slowing as it reaches its position.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;Lower lines start earlier. Each line takes 0.2–0.5 s; their start times&lt;br&gt;are offset so every line finishes together at 0.5 s.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;The wordmark and Menu stay in place.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;With reduced motion, these page animations and the exit wait are&lt;br&gt;skipped.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=24;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#111111;fontColor=#111111;strokeWidth=2;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
