        <mxCell id="about-arrival" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:20px;line-height:28px;text-align:left;white-space:nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:0px;&quot;&gt;Select About in a menu opened from another page.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;Over 0.5 s, the menu links slide upward out of view and Close fades out.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;If leaving Works, allow 1 s for its two-part exit; other pages allow 0.5 s.&lt;br&gt;Then request the new page.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;The white menu stays in place until the new page is ready, then disappears.&lt;br&gt;Loading may add a pause.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;Once About is ready, restart the times below:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;Each line of the heading and paragraphs rises slightly and fades in, slowing&lt;br&gt;as it reaches its position.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;Lower lines start earlier. Each line takes 0.2–0.5 s; their start times are&lt;br&gt;offset so every line finishes together at 0.5 s.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;The wordmark stays visible. The new Menu button fades in over 0.5 s.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=24;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#111111;fontColor=#111111;strokeWidth=2;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1060" y="2885" width="740" height="620" />
        </mxCell>
