        <mxCell id="about-to-works" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:20px;line-height:28px;text-align:left;white-space:nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:0px;&quot;&gt;Use Back / Forward to return to a previously visited Works page, with&lt;br&gt;the menu closed.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;All text lines start moving slightly upward and fading out together.&lt;br&gt;Upper lines finish sooner: durations increase from 0.2 s at the top to&lt;br&gt;0.5 s at the bottom.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;After 0.5 s, change page.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;Once Works is ready, restart the times below. Loading may add a&lt;br&gt;pause:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;The pictures are uncovered from bottom to top while staying in place:&lt;br&gt;Genesis takes 0.8 s, shanzhy.io 0.5 s, and Workspace 1 s. All three&lt;br&gt;start together.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;The heading waits 0.5 s, then slides up into view over 0.5 s.&lt;br&gt;Everything finishes at 1 s.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;The wordmark and Menu stay in place.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;With reduced motion, these page animations and the exit wait are&lt;br&gt;skipped.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=24;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#111111;fontColor=#111111;strokeWidth=2;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="860" y="4190" width="680" height="650" />
