          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1890.0" y="5790" width="460" height="110" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="genesis-cold" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:20px;line-height:28px;text-align:left;white-space:nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:0px;&quot;&gt;Show the loading percentage on white. Wait for the page, fonts and visible images&lt;br&gt;plus the video.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;Loading time varies. At 100%, the loading screen fades away over 0.5 s. Page&lt;br&gt;animations wait until it is gone.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;Start the following times after the loading screen disappears:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;The title and description rise slightly and fade in. Lower lines start earlier; all lines&lt;br&gt;finish at 0.5 s.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;At the same time, the video is uncovered from bottom to top over 0.5 s, while the&lt;br&gt;picture stays still. The GitHub link also fades in over 0.5 s.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;The poster stays visible until a video frame is ready.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;The wordmark and Menu fade in at the same time, over 0.5 s.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;With reduced motion, the loading fade and page entrance are skipped.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=24;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#111111;fontColor=#111111;strokeWidth=2;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1720.0" y="5980" width="800" height="620" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="genesis-origin" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:30px;line-height:40px;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:0px;&quot;&gt;Works&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=24;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#111111;fontColor=#111111;strokeWidth=2;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="2730.0" y="5300" width="600" height="130" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="genesis-arrival" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:20px;line-height:28px;text-align:left;white-space:nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:0px;&quot;&gt;Click the Genesis picture in Works.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;0–0.5 s: any expanded picture returns to its usual width; color returns to&lt;br&gt;grayscale and project names fade away.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;0.5–1 s: the heading slides upward out of view. The pictures are covered&lt;br&gt;from bottom to top, without moving the pictures themselves.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;At 1 s, request Genesis. Wait until it is ready, then start its entrance:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;The title and description rise slightly and fade in. Lower lines start earlier; all&lt;br&gt;lines finish at 0.5 s.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;At the same time, the video is uncovered from bottom to top over 0.5 s,&lt;br&gt;while the picture stays still. The GitHub link also fades in over 0.5 s.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;The poster stays visible until a video frame is ready.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;The wordmark and Menu stay in place.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;With reduced motion, the exit wait and page animations are skipped.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=24;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#111111;fontColor=#111111;strokeWidth=2;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="2660.0" y="5485" width="740" height="620" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="genesis-menu" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:30px;line-height:40px;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:0px;&quot;&gt;Nav menu&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=24;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#111111;fontColor=#111111;strokeWidth=2;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="4290.0" y="5995" width="350" height="140" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="genesis-close" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:20px;line-height:28px;text-align:left;white-space:nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:0px;&quot;&gt;Click Close.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;0–0.5 s: the links slide upward out of view.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;0.5–1 s: the white panel fades away.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;Close fades out in the first 0.5 s; Menu fades in during the next&lt;br&gt;0.5 s. The wordmark stays visible.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;The same page is revealed; its entrance does not restart.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=24;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#111111;fontColor=#111111;strokeWidth=2;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="3480.0" y="5765" width="650" height="360" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="genesis-open" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:20px;line-height:28px;text-align:left;white-space:nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:0px;&quot;&gt;Click Menu.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;0–0.5 s: the white menu panel fades in over the page. The&lt;br&gt;wordmark stays visible.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;0.5–1 s: the menu links slide upward into view.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;The Menu label fades out over the first 0.5 s; Close fades in over&lt;br&gt;the next 0.5 s.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;The page stays underneath; its exit animation does not run.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=24;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#111111;fontColor=#111111;strokeWidth=2;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="3480.0" y="6230" width="650" height="380" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="genesis-to-home" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:20px;line-height:28px;text-align:left;white-space:nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:0px;&quot;&gt;Use Back / Forward to return to a previously visited Home page, with&lt;br&gt;the menu closed.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;Over 0.5 s, the text rises slightly and fades out, the video is covered&lt;br&gt;from bottom to top, and the GitHub link fades away. Then change&lt;br&gt;page.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;The wordmark and Menu fade out during this 0.5 s exit.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;Once Home is ready, a white cover moves upward off the screen&lt;br&gt;over 1 s, revealing the black background.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;Then the scene begins: point fades in (0–0.4 s), square opens&lt;br&gt;(0.4–1.1 s), cube opens (1.1–1.8 s), tesseract opens (1.8–2.5 s).&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;At 2.5 s, the shape starts moving. The title and Explore link fade in&lt;br&gt;from 2.5 to 3 s.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;Home finishes entering 4 s after it is ready. Any route-loading wait&lt;br&gt;comes before this.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;With reduced motion, these page animations and the exit wait are&lt;br&gt;skipped.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=24;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#111111;fontColor=#111111;strokeWidth=2;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1700.0" y="6790" width="680" height="650" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="genesis-target-home" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:30px;line-height:40px;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:0px;&quot;&gt;Home&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=24;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#111111;fontColor=#111111;strokeWidth=2;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1900.0" y="7520" width="280" height="100" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="genesis-to-works" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:20px;line-height:28px;text-align:left;white-space:nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:0px;&quot;&gt;Use Back / Forward to return to a previously visited Works page, with&lt;br&gt;the menu closed.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;Over 0.5 s, the text rises slightly and fades out, the video is covered&lt;br&gt;from bottom to top, and the GitHub link fades away. Then change&lt;br&gt;page.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;Once Works is ready, restart the times below. Loading may add a&lt;br&gt;pause:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;The pictures are uncovered from bottom to top while staying in place:&lt;br&gt;Genesis takes 0.8 s, shanzhy.io 0.5 s, and Workspace 1 s. All three&lt;br&gt;start together.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;The heading waits 0.5 s, then slides up into view over 0.5 s.&lt;br&gt;Everything finishes at 1 s.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;The wordmark and Menu stay in place.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;With reduced motion, these page animations and the exit wait are&lt;br&gt;skipped.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=24;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#111111;fontColor=#111111;strokeWidth=2;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="2460.0" y="6790" width="680" height="650" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="genesis-target-works" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:30px;line-height:40px;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:0px;&quot;&gt;Works&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=24;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#111111;fontColor=#111111;strokeWidth=2;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="2660.0" y="7520" width="280" height="100" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="genesis-to-about" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:20px;line-height:28px;text-align:left;white-space:nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:0px;&quot;&gt;Use Back / Forward to return to a previously visited About page, with&lt;br&gt;the menu closed.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;Over 0.5 s, the text rises slightly and fades out, the video is covered&lt;br&gt;from bottom to top, and the GitHub link fades away. Then change&lt;br&gt;page.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;Once About is ready, restart the times below. Loading may add a&lt;br&gt;pause:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;Each line of the heading and paragraphs rises slightly and fades in,&lt;br&gt;slowing as it reaches its position.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;Lower lines start earlier. Each line takes 0.2–0.5 s; their start times&lt;br&gt;are offset so every line finishes together at 0.5 s.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;The wordmark and Menu stay in place.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;With reduced motion, these page animations and the exit wait are&lt;br&gt;skipped.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=24;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#111111;fontColor=#111111;strokeWidth=2;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="3220.0" y="6790" width="680" height="650" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="genesis-target-about" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:30px;line-height:40px;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:0px;&quot;&gt;About&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=24;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#111111;fontColor=#111111;strokeWidth=2;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="3420.0" y="7520" width="280" height="100" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="genesis-to-contact" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:20px;line-height:28px;text-align:left;white-space:nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:0px;&quot;&gt;Use Back / Forward to return to a previously visited Contact page,&lt;br&gt;with the menu closed.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;Over 0.5 s, the text rises slightly and fades out, the video is covered&lt;br&gt;from bottom to top, and the GitHub link fades away. Then change&lt;br&gt;page.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;Once Contact is ready, restart the times below. Loading may add a&lt;br&gt;pause:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;The five rows rise slightly and fade in. From Instagram up to the&lt;br&gt;heading, they start at 0, 0.075, 0.15, 0.225 and 0.3 s.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;All five rows finish together at 0.5 s.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;The wordmark and Menu stay in place.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;With reduced motion, these page animations and the exit wait are&lt;br&gt;skipped.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=24;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#111111;fontColor=#111111;strokeWidth=2;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="3980.0" y="6790" width="680" height="650" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="genesis-target-contact" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:30px;line-height:40px;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:0px;&quot;&gt;Contact&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=24;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#111111;fontColor=#111111;strokeWidth=2;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="4180.0" y="7520" width="280" height="100" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>